  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.2 - Stable Release:\n\t\t\t✅ Production-ready N-Tier architecture generator\n\t\t\t✅ Fixed package versions for stability (AutoMapper 12.0.1, EF Core 8.0.0)\n\t\t\t✅ Complete 5-layer architecture (Core, DAL, Business, API, Shared)\n\t\t\t✅ Generic Repository Pattern with CRUD operations\n\t\t\t✅ Soft delete support with global query filters\n\t\t\t✅ AutoMapper configuration generation\n\t\t\t✅ FluentValidation integration\n\t\t\t✅ Sample CRUD controller with Swagger\n\t\t\t✅ Connection retry strategy and CORS support\n\t\t\t✅ Audit fields (CreatedDate, UpdatedDate, IsDeleted)\n\t\t\t✅ Clean project structure with dependency injection\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tQuick Start:\n\t\t\t1. dotnet tool install --global NetSchema\n\t\t\t2. cd YourSolution\n\t\t\t3. dotnet netschema generate\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tGitHub: https://github.com/emilhuseyn/NetSchema",
